  "stories": [
    {
      "story_id": "US-001",
      "revision_id": "R1",
      "title": "beacon-v1.3.3-minimal-hud-scenarios-and-implementation",
      "priority": "medium",
      "status": "accepted",
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "AC-001",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "general",
          "text": "S1-S6 场景渲染稳定：`help/status` 可稳定覆盖主链空闲、single、team、ralph、warn、blocked/trip 六类场景。",
          "required": true,
          "status": "accepted",
          "implemented_by_run_id": "run-20260417T045517Z-529b",
          "verified_by_run_id": "review.accept",
          "accepted_at": "2026-04-17T05:01:11.564720+00:00",
          "changed_in_revision": "R1",
          "story_id": "",
          "details": [],
          "source": "user-story:docs/beacon/v1.3.3/user-story/beacon-v1.3.3-minimal-hud-scenarios-and-implementation.md"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-002",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "general",
          "text": "HUD 行数预算受控：正常场景最多 2 行，仅 warn/blocked 允许第 3 行。",
          "required": true,
          "status": "accepted",
          "implemented_by_run_id": "run-20260417T045517Z-529b",
          "verified_by_run_id": "review.accept",
          "accepted_at": "2026-04-17T05:01:11.564720+00:00",
          "changed_in_revision": "R1",
          "story_id": "",
          "details": [],
          "source": "user-story:docs/beacon/v1.3.3/user-story/beacon-v1.3.3-minimal-hud-scenarios-and-implementation.md"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-003",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "general",
          "text": "最小决策字段完整：必须包含 `stage`、执行摘要（single/team/ralph）、`next_action`，阻断时包含 `recommended_command`。",
          "required": true,
          "status": "accepted",
          "implemented_by_run_id": "run-20260417T045517Z-529b",
          "verified_by_run_id": "review.accept",
          "accepted_at": "2026-04-17T05:01:11.564720+00:00",
          "changed_in_revision": "R1",
          "story_id": "",
          "details": [],
          "source": "user-story:docs/beacon/v1.3.3/user-story/beacon-v1.3.3-minimal-hud-scenarios-and-implementation.md"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-004",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "general",
          "text": "Ralph HUD 可观测闭环：输出含 `phase`、`round_count`、`stop_state`、`next_action`、`current_blocker`、`failure_streak`、`no_delta_streak`。",
          "required": true,
          "status": "accepted",
          "implemented_by_run_id": "run-20260417T045517Z-529b",
          "verified_by_run_id": "review.accept",
          "accepted_at": "2026-04-17T05:01:11.564720+00:00",
          "changed_in_revision": "R1",
          "story_id": "",
          "details": [],
          "source": "user-story:docs/beacon/v1.3.3/user-story/beacon-v1.3.3-minimal-hud-scenarios-and-implementation.md"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-005",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "general",
          "text": "Team HUD 可观测执行摘要：输出含 `team_state`、`terminal_status`、`review_gates`、`fix_loops` 与角色最新事件摘要。",
          "required": true,
          "status": "accepted",
          "implemented_by_run_id": "run-20260417T045517Z-529b",
          "verified_by_run_id": "review.accept",
          "accepted_at": "2026-04-17T05:01:11.564720+00:00",
          "changed_in_revision": "R1",
          "story_id": "",
          "details": [],
          "source": "user-story:docs/beacon/v1.3.3/user-story/beacon-v1.3.3-minimal-hud-scenarios-and-implementation.md"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-006",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "general",
          "text": "命令面不扩张且兼容：不新增公开一级命令；`help/status --json` 保持向后兼容（仅增字段不删字段）。",
          "required": true,
          "status": "accepted",
          "implemented_by_run_id": "run-20260417T045517Z-529b",
          "verified_by_run_id": "review.accept",
          "accepted_at": "2026-04-17T05:01:11.564720+00:00",
          "changed_in_revision": "R1",
          "story_id": "",
          "details": [],
          "source": "user-story:docs/beacon/v1.3.3/user-story/beacon-v1.3.3-minimal-hud-scenarios-and-implementation.md"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-007",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "general",
          "text": "阻断恢复一致性：compatibility 阻断统一推荐 `beacon doctor migrate-compat ...`；机器侧仍保留完整 JSON/artifacts。",
          "required": true,
          "status": "accepted",
          "implemented_by_run_id": "run-20260417T045517Z-529b",
          "verified_by_run_id": "review.accept",
          "accepted_at": "2026-04-17T05:01:11.564720+00:00",
          "changed_in_revision": "R1",
          "story_id": "",
          "details": [],
          "source": "user-story:docs/beacon/v1.3.3/user-story/beacon-v1.3.3-minimal-hud-scenarios-and-implementation.md"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-008",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "general",
          "text": "Codex 固定 HUD 注入：hook 输出必须通过 `hookSpecificOutput.additionalContext` 返回 1-3 行 HUD，且文本来自 `minimal_hud` 同一渲染契约。",
          "required": true,
          "status": "accepted",
          "implemented_by_run_id": "run-20260417T045517Z-529b",
          "verified_by_run_id": "review.accept",
          "accepted_at": "2026-04-17T05:01:11.564720+00:00",
          "changed_in_revision": "R1",
          "story_id": "",
          "details": [],
          "source": "user-story:docs/beacon/v1.3.3/user-story/beacon-v1.3.3-minimal-hud-scenarios-and-implementation.md"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-009",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "general",
          "text": "自动注入事件覆盖：必须覆盖 `UserPromptSubmit`，并支持会话刷新事件（`SessionStart/SessionResume/SessionRefresh` 至少其一可配置）。",
          "required": true,
          "status": "accepted",
          "implemented_by_run_id": "run-20260417T045517Z-529b",
          "verified_by_run_id": "review.accept",
          "accepted_at": "2026-04-17T05:01:11.564720+00:00",
          "changed_in_revision": "R1",
          "story_id": "",
          "details": [],
          "source": "user-story:docs/beacon/v1.3.3/user-story/beacon-v1.3.3-minimal-hud-scenarios-and-implementation.md"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-010",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "general",
          "text": "Hook 治理与降级：hook 安装/校验必须走 `beacon doctor`；hook 失败不得阻断主输入流程，必须降级并写 debug 证据。",
          "required": true,
          "status": "accepted",
          "implemented_by_run_id": "run-20260417T045517Z-529b",
          "verified_by_run_id": "review.accept",
          "accepted_at": "2026-04-17T05:01:11.564720+00:00",
          "changed_in_revision": "R1",
          "story_id": "",
          "details": [],
          "source": "user-story:docs/beacon/v1.3.3/user-story/beacon-v1.3.3-minimal-hud-scenarios-and-implementation.md"
        },
